<h3>Why hydration matters</h3>

Water supports digestion, circulation, temperature regulation, joint
lubrication and nutrient transport.

<h3>How this is calculated</h3>

Your baseline is derived from body weight, then adjusted for how active
you are and the climate you spend your day in. Results are capped at four
litres per day.

<h3>Where fluid comes from</h3>

Not all of it needs to be plain water. Above 2,800 ml a day, your result
includes a suggested split between water, other drinks and fluid from
food.
